# Changing_VFO_A
Changing VFO
Changing_VFO_
Click
Move
Moving
Option 1: Move the mouse cursor over the digit you wish to tune. While  holding down the left mouse button, move the mouse left to tune down or right to tune up. Release the left mouse button when you have finished tuning.
Option 2: Move the cursor over the digit you wish to tune . Click the right mouse button. The cursor will disappear and the select digit will be highlighted. Moving the mouse will now change this digit, right will increase & left will decrease. To exit f
Option 3: Click on the button marked VFO
Option 4: Click on
Release
